    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/tracking-daily-budget/1.mp3",
      "text": "Let us sit down together and review our total budget for the weekend camping trip.",
      "textSha256": "f531a5185e7b38ef43fe813e070c041ce65ac7d670e40792eb1f21bb09515ef8"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/tracking-daily-budget/2.mp3",
      "text": "We spent money on fresh food and fifty dollars on tent rental equipment.",
      "textSha256": "b332a4930b4a5b4f5449dbb4f7539f1cf4fc53ba35545f2d33c7cbf5fb52d2f8"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/tracking-daily-budget/3.mp3",
      "text": "Buying the cooking charcoal in a bundle deal saved us twenty dollars.",
      "textSha256": "57e7b25d0e15ed53d0f7e463c34a382cad3c3fd2a932f83a4b5d64f1ca54ecfb"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/tracking-daily-budget/4.mp3",
      "text": "What was the final total cost when we combine all the receipts together?",
      "textSha256": "0218513c8f2c336fa83a97d795b423d4c3ebb09e5ac11a2242daeeb09cd2b0a4"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/tracking-daily-budget/5.mp3",
      "text": "The total comes to two hundred dollars, so each person pays fifty dollars.",
      "textSha256": "b12b1b952e749654fd1bf73a0604a2891b3e4f9e3cdf74beee3518a6de42d13c"
    },
    {
      "src": "/audio/sentences/tracking-daily-budget/6.mp3",
      "text": "We share the expenses equally and it was worth every single dollar we spent.",
      "textSha256": "ee30e07f3170ad3bb943c66abaf92379ce24bc653294782c8792034791c08f29"
    },
